OL,5,G1700 Frozen Planet
OL,6,     FAutumn: Witness how solar
OL,7,     Flandscapes change as the big
OL,8,     Ffreeze returns. Most animals leave
OL,9,     Fon epic journeys, some battle to
OL,10,     Fbreed and for a few it is a time
OL,11,     Fof opportunity.
OL,12,G1800 Frozen Planet
OL,13,     FWinter: During winter most animals
OL,14,     Fabandon the polar regions, but a
OL,15,     Ffew extreme survivors remain. This
OL,16,     Fis the story of their battles to
OL,17,     Fendure the planet's harshest
OL,18,     Fwinters.
